# Website Prompt — Ink & Cream AI Assistant
## Character-Driven Animated Website with Embedded AI

---

## Project Overview

Build a **fully animated, single-page personal assistant website** centered around an original anime character — a hand-drawn Victorian/Lolita-style girl with long dark braided hair, ruffled blouse, suspender skirt with bow accents, and large expressive eyes. The character is rendered in **ink pen lineart style** (monochrome, hatching shading) on a cream notebook paper background. She acts as the site's AI assistant — speaking, reacting, and guiding the user.

---

## Character Reference (from provided image)

The character must be reproduced faithfully as a **layered SVG or CSS illustration**, or as a **sprite sheet for animation**:

- **Hair** — long dark hair, loosely braided over one shoulder, with side-swept bangs and a soft center part
- **Eyes** — large anime-style eyes with detailed lashes and subtle highlights; slightly wide, curious expression
- **Outfit** — sleeveless ruffled blouse with cascading ribbon/bow detail at center chest; wide suspender straps clipping onto a wide corset waistband; full pleated/gathered skirt flowing below
- **Mole** — small ink dot below the left eye (character mark, do not omit)
- **Art style** — monochrome ink pen lineart, cross-hatching for shadow, no fill color, hand-drawn quality

> The character should be rendered large (40–50% of viewport height), anchored bottom-left or bottom-center of the screen, and feel like she is physically present on the page.

