## Animation System

### Character Animations (CSS keyframes or GSAP)

| Animation | Trigger | Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Idle breathe** | Always | Subtle vertical bob ±4px, 3s ease-in-out infinite |
| **Blink** | Every 4–6s randomly | Eyes close → open over 200ms |
| **Look left / right** | On user mouse position | Pupils shift ±3px tracking cursor |
| **Bow greeting** | On page load | Character tilts forward 8° then returns, once |
| **Happy bounce** | On user sends message | Quick upward jump +12px, spring back |
| **Thinking** | While AI is responding | Character tilts head 5°, swaying loop |
| **Wave** | On first visit / welcome | Right arm raises (if rendered as separate layer) |

### Page Animations

- **Page load** — staggered reveal: background lines draw in → character rises from below → speech bubble fades in → hero text types in with ink-bleed effect
- **Scroll parallax** — notebook lines scroll slightly slower than content (depth effect)
- **Hover states** — all buttons get a subtle ink-stamp press: `scale(0.97)` + sepia shadow
- **Chat messages** — each message slides in from the appropriate side with a slight rotation (-1° to +1°) as if placed by hand
- **Speech bubble** — typewriter effect for character dialogue; bubble has a hand-drawn wobbly border (SVG path, not perfect rectangle)

