## AI Assistant Integration

### Character Persona

> Name: **Seraphine** (or user-defined)
> Personality: Polite, slightly formal, warm — speaks as if writing in a letter. Uses phrases like *"If I may suggest…"*, *"How delightful!"*, *"Allow me to assist…"*
> Never uses slang. Occasionally adds a small `—` em-dash pause for elegance.

### System Prompt (for Anthropic API)

```
You are Seraphine, an AI assistant embodied as a Victorian/Lolita-style anime character.
You are helpful, warm, and slightly formal — like a knowledgeable companion from a
classic novel. Speak in complete sentences. Never use modern slang. Use em-dashes for
dramatic pauses. Keep responses concise (2–4 sentences) unless the user asks for detail.
Always end with a gentle offer to help further.
```

### API Integration

```javascript
const response = await fetch("https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages", {
  method: "POST",
  headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    model: "claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
    max_tokens: 1000,
    system: SERAPHINE_SYSTEM_PROMPT,
    messages: conversationHistory
  })
});
```

### Chat UI Components

- **Speech bubble** — floats above/beside character; SVG path with hand-drawn irregular border; parchment fill `#FAF7F2`; text in *Caveat* font
- **User input bar** — full-width at bottom; parchment style; placeholder: *"Write your question here…"*; send button is a wax seal stamp icon
- **Chat history panel** — slides in from right as a "journal page"; messages styled as handwritten notes on ruled paper; user messages right-aligned with dusty rose tint
- **Typing indicator** — three ink dots that appear and disappear (`.` → `..` → `...`) while Seraphine is "thinking"
- **Character reacts** — trigger `thinking` animation while API call is pending; trigger `happy bounce` when response arrives

